; SniperTurtle_KZ_v1.00  -  TRADE, from V4_notrail
;
; THE CONFIG, and only what differs from the EA's own defaults:
;   InpEmaFast   9 -> 50      InpEmaMid  21 -> 100     InpEmaTrend 50 -> 200
;   InpTrailBehindTP   true -> FALSE      <- the one that matters
;   InpUseHalfSlOutside true -> false
;   InpUseSessionFilter true -> false     (killzone window is the only gate)
;   InpUseSessionLots   true -> false     (so InpRiskPercent 0.5% actually applies)
;   InpEnableQFilter   false -> true, with VWAP as the ONLY condition on
;
; WHY THE PAIR: 50/100 with the trail ON made -323 across 2025. With it off,
; +4889. Neither change works alone. A slow signal produces a payoff near 22,
; so letting winners run is worth a great deal; on the stock 9/21 signal the
; payoff is ~2 and there is nothing to let run. That is why the same trail
; change failed when it was tried on 9/21 in the v2 grid.
;
; EVIDENCE, 6 backtests, 25k deposit, XAUUSD:
;             M15              M5               M3
;   2026   +4983 PF2.44   +11255 PF1.61    +1639 PF1.06
;   2025   +3519 PF1.51    -1909 PF0.93    +3280 PF1.07
;   Best of 138 runs, and the only config clearly profitable in BOTH years.
;
; WHAT IT HAS NOT PASSED:
;   * M5 2025 LOSES (PF 0.93). It is not positive on all three timeframes in
;     both years, which was the bar set before the run.
;   * 2026 and 2025 are the years it was SELECTED on. 2024 and 2023 have not
;     been run - that is turtle-grid/RUN_V5.bat, and it should be run before
;     this file goes anywhere near real money.
;   * M15 is the strongest frame in both years (PF 2.44 and 1.51, DD 4.8%).
;     If you trade one frame, that is the evidence-backed one - NOT M3, whose
;     PF is 1.06 and which was barely above water.
;
; Telegram is OFF here - fill InpTgToken / InpTgChatId on the machine.
; Check InpServerGmtOffset against the broker: the killzone window is cut from
; a NY clock derived from it, and this config has no other time gate.
